    <string name="qobuz_audio_quality_section">Audio quality (experimental)</string>
    <string name="qobuz_enable">Use Qobuz for lossless playback</string>
    <string name="qobuz_enable_description">Experimental. Uses third-party services (not run by us) to fetch FLAC or Hi-Res streams when the song exists on Qobuz. May stop working at any time without warning — when it does, playback falls back automatically to the standard YouTube source. Lossless streams use 3–10× more data and storage than the standard AAC.\n\nChanging this setting (or quality / backend / country) reloads the currently playing track to apply the new source immediately. No app restart required.</string>
